/T (This course applies Lean Thinking to office and administrative environments. Participants will learn how to identify hidden waste in everyday tasks such as emails, approvals, paperwork, and meetings. After determining the wastes, this course will show you how to apply the Lean tools to streamline operations, improve accuracy, and create more value with less effort. Designed for all office settings, such as finance, HR, customer services, and procurement, with a practical hands-on activity to help participants not just understand Lean tools but also how to apply them.  )
/E (This course applies Lean Thinking to office and administrative environments. Participants will learn how to identify hidden waste in everyday tasks such as emails, approvals, paperwork, and meetings. After determining the wastes, this course will show you how to apply the Lean tools to streamline operations, improve accuracy, and create more value with less effort. Designed for all office settings, such as finance, HR, customer services, and procurement, with a practical hands-on activity to help participants not just understand Lean tools but also how to apply them.  )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
