/T (This immersive course equips professionals with advanced tools and techniques to solve complex problems, eliminate recurring issues, and drive lasting improvements. Going beyond basic troubleshooting, participants will learn how to apply structured methodologies such as A3, 5 Whys, Fishbone Diagrams, and PDCA. An emphasis is placed on team-based problem-solving, root cause validation, and implementing countermeasures that are effective and sustainable. Utilizing our Lean Manufacturing simulation, participants will apply these techniques to real problems. )
